    "At the same time, you value accuracy and doing work in a proper way.",
    "You like to communicate clearly while also paying attention to details.",
    "You can motivate people while ensuring that work is organized and well planned.",
    "People may see you as an energetic yet responsible member who can communicate well and handle tasks carefully.",
    "Your 8 Intelligences",
    "1. Logical\u2013Numerical Intelligence (Numbers & Accounts)  Level: Good",
